usage: tok [options] PATH
tokenize a dewy file

  path                  Path              the file to tokenize
  -v, --verbose         bool              print each token
  -t=, tabsize=         int64<value => 0 <? value and value <=? 16> spaces per tab (default 4)
  mode=                 'tokens' | 'ast'  what to print (default tokens)
  include=              array<Path>       extra files, repeatable (repeatable)
  out=                  string            where to write (optional)
  --plain               bool              no colors
  -h, --help                              show this help
